cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with GCMMA-MMA-Python (Deetman) and the papers by Svanberg (1987, 2002)."
type: software
title: "MMA-DUAL: MMA and GCMMA subproblems solved by the dual method"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23770400
url: "https://github.com/olavosilva/MMA-DUAL"
repository-code: "https://github.com/olavosilva/MMA-DUAL"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
  - family-names: Silva
    given-names: Olavo M.
    affiliation: "Laboratório de Vibrações e Acústica / Multidisciplinary Optimization Group (LVA-MOPT), Universidade Federal de Santa Catarina"
keywords:
  - method of moving asymptotes
  - MMA
  - GCMMA
  - dual method
  - topology optimization
  - structural optimization
abstract: "Drop-in replacements for mmasub and gcmmasub of GCMMA-MMA-Python in which the separable convex subproblem of the MMA/GCMMA is solved by its dual (Svanberg, 1987): a projected Newton method with analytical Hessian on the m Lagrange multipliers, for problems with few constraints (m much smaller than n)."
